{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> defined by the following table:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84f712e7e4892f74560db780058a7bd3b1c60a62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{c|cccc} * &amp; 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 \\\\ \\hline 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 \\\\ 2 &amp; 2 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 &amp; 3 \\\\ 3 &amp; 3 &amp; 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 2 \\\\ 4 &amp; 4 &amp; 3 &amp; 2 &amp; 1 \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"100\" />\n</p><p>For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/473fbe3117e81103b22efd6c17d50f069c8aad2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3*2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fb56d20192d09df271e2d3a8374f078a0454988.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2*4)*(1*3)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca585cb0a10d1b1516363ba9bbb1b7681a8a00ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the chart, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32ed19a96b797b5c2b40bf057557260b3350bb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2*4)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f229aa05f053c2f3084287063c88243ad7b852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1*3)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e5cd6bbc16cbcdd6b398cc4aa0120ce0b63164.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2*4)*(1*3)=3*3=\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"252\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the chart, we can see that the \"<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" />\" operation is actually multiplication modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82389e8aa9e01575aea346f8a49a3660969363b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2*4)*(1*3)\\rightarrow(2\\cdot4)\\cdot(1\\cdot3)=8\\cdot3=24\\rightarrow\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"428\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-JeffersonJ\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"cente